            description: Some("Creates a voice profile, which consists of an enrolled user and their latest voice print.  Before creating any voice profiles, you must provide all notices and obtain all consents from the speaker as required under applicable privacy and biometrics laws, and as required under the AWS service terms for the Amazon Chime SDK.  For more information about voice profiles and voice analytics, see Using Amazon Chime SDK Voice Analytics in the Amazon Chime SDK Developer Guide"),
